  "_about": "cc-P180: the look rules for build_burrows.py. One seed per zone (change it for a new layout, keep it for the same one); tile weights are relative (any scale); every id is a stock EA tile id as a hex string. Walls: ew = the piece whose slab sits on its tile's SOUTH edge (runs along x), ns = slab on the EAST edge (runs along y), corner = both slabs, post = the SE corner point only; see notes/uo-wall-orientation.md. Decor rules: where = nearWall | open | any | wallFace (floor tiles just south or east of a wall tile); density = clusters per eligible tile; cluster = [min, max] pieces; radius = cluster spread (Chebyshev); spacing = least distance between cluster centres; z = offsets drawn at random. Impassable pieces are kept off narrow paths and spawner homes by the builder.",
